  "semantics": {
    "identity": "Exact registered candidate ID plus title, normalised DOI and public source links. No inferred canonical work. Public entity and evidence IDs are response-local; private target, proposal and source IDs never leave storage.",
    "availability": "available, not_assessed, stale, not_registered and withheld describe the public projection only. They are not research review decisions or contribution categories.",
    "assessment": "Only unreviewed_proposal is supported by the current source schema. No confirmed state, scientific eligibility or calibration acceptance can be inferred. Automated generation is flagged when recorded model provenance exists; otherwise production mode is unspecified.",
    "source_basis": "Facts retain source/analyst attribution and field missingness. Public links and locators replace private source references; source bodies and offsets are not projected. not_reported is limited to consulted material.",
    "privacy": "No reviewer identity, generated_by, analyst_limitations working notes, original source text, private storage IDs, credentials or unsafe/signed locators. Long source quotations and structurally invalid/stale extractions are withheld. Public-facing framework rationales are analyst paraphrases, never confirmation.",
    "freshness": "Read-only projection of current immutable source-backed proposal, no second data store or scheduler. No-store requests on each sheet opening. Content digest changes when any projected fact changes even if counts remain unchanged. Existing authenticated observer verifies source-derived digests against unauthenticated HTTP responses."
  }
